{"step_index":1998,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T17:39:08Z","content":"### 🛠️ Gemini API Models Updated & Dynamic Discovery Implemented!\n\nYou caught a key deprecation: older versions of `gemini-1.5-flash` were returning `404 Not Found` from Google's API.\n\n---\n\n### 🔍 Current Active Google Gemini Models:\n- **`gemini-2.5-flash`** — Active primary workhorse for ultra-fast OCR, vision reasoning, and structured JSON parsing.\n- **`gemini-2.5-pro`** — Active high-capacity reasoning model.\n- **`gemini-2.0-flash` & `gemini-2.0-flash-lite`** — Active fast inference models.\n- **`gemini-3.7-flash` & `gemini-3.5-flash`** — Latest generation active models.\n- **`gemini-1.5-flash-latest` & `gemini-1.5-pro-latest`** — Active alias pointers.\n\n---\n\n### 🛡️ Permanent Solution Implemented: Dynamic Model Discovery\n\nRather than relying purely on hardcoded model strings that Google could retire in the future, we built [`GeminiModelService`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/geminiModelService.ts):\n\n1. **Live Model Discovery:** When you scan or draft an AI text, the app queries Google's `GET /v1beta/models` endpoint for the exact live, active models enabled for your API key.\n2. **Prioritized Flash Vision Cascade:** It automatically sorts and picks the fastest, highest-accuracy Flash vision models first (e.g. `gemini-2.5-flash`).\n3. **Resilient Offline / Active Fallback:** If dynamic discovery is unreachable, it defaults to the verified active lineup (`gemini-2.5-flash`, `gemini-2.5-pro`, `gemini-2.0-flash`, `gemini-3.7-flash`).\n\nBoth the **Card Scanner ([`visionService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/visionService.ts))** and **AI SMS Drafter ([`aiSmsService.ts`](file:///C:/Users/brorm/.gemini/antigravity/scratch/snap-dialer/src/services/aiSmsService.ts))** now use this dynamic engine.\n\n---\n\n### 🌐 Live Production Deployment\nThe fix is compiled and live on Surge:\n👉 **[https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh](https://valuteachers-dialer.surge.sh)**"}
