{"step_index":2014,"source":"MODEL","type":"PLANNER_RESPONSE","status":"DONE","created_at":"2026-08-23T21:22:21Z","thinking":"**Reviewing Recommended Enhancements**\n\nI'm currently reviewing the WORLD-CLASS ENHANCEMENT ROADMAP and the hybrid scheduling/calendar integration. Right now I am looking over the items listed in the \"Hybrid Calendar Scheduling & Piping\" section. The focus is to ensure a comprehensive integration and implementation strategy.\n\n\n**Implementing Calendar Integration**\n\nI've been working on integrating calendar features. I'm focusing on `.ics` generation for one-tap downloads, with Apple Calendar triggers for iOS and Mac. I'm also including direct web composer links for Google Calendar and Outlook/Office 365, with pre-filled event summaries. This functionality will be integrated into the appointment setting flow within the `DialerHudScreen` and `LeadDetailScreen`.\n\n\n**Developing Agent Dialing Tools**\n\nI'm developing features for agents, adding a school campus filter to the lead list so agents can dial educators at a single campus. I've integrated school filter support into the lead repository. Next I'll work on the planning period visual heatmap and weekly sit-down planner. This heatmap will show booked slots and allow 1-tap bookings. I'm also planning the interactive objection battlecards overlay in the HUD.\n\n\n","tool_calls":[{"name":"write_to_file","args":{"ArtifactMetadata":"{\"RequestFeedback\":true,\"Summary\":\"Implementation plan for World-Class Enhancements: Hybrid Calendar Piping (Apple/Google/Outlook), Campus-Clustered Dialing, Planning Period Heatmap, Live Objection Battlecards, CSV Pipeline Sync, and Callback Reminders.\",\"UserFacing\":true}","CodeContent":"\"# Implementation Plan: World-Class ValuTeachers Dialer & Calendar Suite\\n\\nThis plan details the implementation of the World-Class Enhancement Roadmap and the Hybrid Calendar Integration suite for SnapDialer.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## User Review Required\\n\\n> [!IMPORTANT]\\n> - **Calendar Integration:** Provides 1-tap Apple Calendar (`.ics`), Google Calendar, and Outlook/Office 365 scheduling with pre-filled room numbers, planning periods, and 15-minute pre-bell alarms without requiring third-party API credentials.\\n> - **Campus Batching:** Enables reps visiting a specific school to filter their calling queue down to that campus with a single tap.\\n> - **Zero-Loss Guarantee:** All exports and CSV pipelines operate on top of the persistent IndexedDB engine.\\n\\n---\\n\\n## Proposed Architecture & Changes\\n\\n```\\n                     ┌────────────────────────────────────────────────────────┐\\n                     │          SNAPDIALER WORLD-CLASS SUITE                  │\\n                     └──────────────────────────┬─────────────────────────────┘\\n                                                │\\n       ┌──────────────────┬─────────────────────┼────────────────────┬──────────────────┐\\n       ▼                  ▼                     ▼                    ▼                  ▼\\n[CALENDAR ENGINE]  [CAMPUS BATCHING]    [OBJECTION HUD]      [CSV SYNC]        [PLANNING HEATMAP]\\n• Apple (.ics)     • Campus Clusters    • Live Battlecards   • Export CSV      • Mon-Fri Grid\\n• Google Link      • School Queueing    • 1-Tap Scripts      • Roster Import   • Period 1-7 Slots\\n• Outlook Link     • Proximity Sort\n<truncated 2634 bytes>","Description":"\"Create implementation plan for World-Class Enhancements and Hybrid Calendar Suite\"","Overwrite":"true","TargetFile":"\"C:\\\\Users\\\\brorm\\\\.gemini\\\\antigravity\\\\brain\\\\9c9b5ef4-82a1-483f-9e9e-cb421c9396b3\\\\implementation_plan.md\"","toolAction":"\"Writing implementation plan\"","toolSummary":"\"Create implementation_plan.md\""}}],"truncated_fields":["tool_calls"]}
